      "observed": "On the MCU sheet, the TPS1H200AQDGNRQ1 (U2) IN pin 1 is connected to the +12V rail (with C13 0.1 uF from that node to GND), while only DIAG_EN pin 2 is connected to NET0003, which is the ESP32-C3-MINI-1 (U8) GPIO1 pin 13 net.",
