        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "IN/DIAG_EN (pins 1/2) are both driven from ESP32 GPIO1 (net /Microcontroller/HEATER)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The heater output would be enabled whenever the 12 V supply is present, independent of firmware GPIO1 control. The bang-bang heater control loop could not turn the heater off, creating an overheating hazard.",
